# Sapphire) the ability is not offered, since Bot1's Master does not lower Bot2's activation. (The runner offers it again with
# mana to spare, so the refusal is for the cost.) (2) On turn 3 Bot1's own Shadowspear Equip {2}, not a ninjutsu ability, is
# paid in full: the two Moxen tapped for it leave the pool empty.

